<figure class="viz" id="viz-gate">
  <p class="chart-title">The yes that opens the last step</p>
  <ol class="gate-row" aria-label="The agent looks things up and puts a picture together, then stops to ask. A person's yes opens the action.">
    <li>
      <p class="gate-kicker">Open</p>
      <p class="gate-name">Look, and put it together</p>
      <p class="gate-copy">The agent builds a picture.</p>
    </li>
    <li>
      <p class="gate-kicker">Open</p>
      <p class="gate-name">Ask</p>
      <p class="gate-copy">The agent stops with a proposal.</p>
    </li>
    <li class="gate-last">
      <p class="gate-kicker">Your yes</p>
      <p class="gate-name">Do it</p>
      <p class="gate-copy">The action waits until you open it.</p>
    </li>
  </ol>
  <figcaption>
    A sketch of the gate. The picture can run ahead, and a person's agreement is what opens the action.
  </figcaption>
</figure>
